                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo zintu ezi zyoonse, ijanza lyangu ndelyakazilenga, zyoonse nzezyangu, mbwaamba Jehova, Pele muntu ngunzoolemeka ngooyu: kufumbwa uulipenzya akulibombya mumoyo, uukankama kumajwi aangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufumbwa uujaya musune uli mbuli oyo uujaya muntu, kufumbwa uutuuzya kabelele uli mbuli oyo uutyolela mubwa insingo, cipaizyo cabusu ncintu comwe abulowa bwangulube, ayooyo uutenta tununkilizyo ulyeelene ayooyo uukomba cikozyano camizimu. Bantu aba balilisalilide inzila zyabo, amyoyo yabo ilabotelwa zisesemyo zyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.1.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tus 1:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino ambebo njoobasalila mapenzi, acintu eco nciconya ncibayoowa njoocileta kulimbabo, nkaambo kakuti nindakaita teebakavuwa, nindakaamba teebakaswiilila, pele bakacita bubi mumeso aangu akusala citandiboteli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
