        {
          "text": "Lino bayooleta bana bakwanu boonse kuzwa kuzisi zyoonse, zibede Jehova cituuzyo. Bayoobaleta balitantide amabbiza, amunkalaki, amunola, aambongolo, aankamele, mane lumwi basike kucilundu cangu cisalala caku-Jerusalemu, mbwaamba Jehova, mbubonya mbuli bana ba-Israyeli mbubaleta zipo zyabusu kuŋanda ya-Jehova mucilido cisalala. ",
